145
00:19:19.043 --> 00:19:23.435
Explained answer key: preserve the shared
validator and score calculation.

146
00:19:23.435 --> 00:19:27.826
In `select`, call `validateDecision`,
filter options with the clearly named

147
00:19:27.826 --> 00:19:32.217
mandatory-constraint predicate, throw `no
eligible option` when the filtered array

148
00:19:32.217 --> 00:19:36.609
is empty, then sort only the eligible
